# WE framework

- Never edit `gamemodes/default/**`. Features only under `src/we/{core,utils,player,features}/`.
- Pk3 AS dir is `progs/gametypes/we/` (never `warfork-extended/` in the pk3). Runtime dir is `basewf/warfork-extended/`. Do not test `"warfork-extended" in path.parts`; use `relative_to(progs/gametypes/we)`.
- Inject: `scripts/inject/` + `scripts/inject.py`; default files `we_` prefix; custom thin pk3 keeps names, no `src/we` copy, wrappers `gen/wrappers_<stem>.as`. New engine `GT_*` hook → `ENGINE_HOOKS` + `HOOK_SIGS` in `scripts/inject/constants.py`. After-hooks: ScoreEvent, ThinkRules, ScoreboardMessage, MatchStateStarted, PlayerRespawn, Shutdown. QPATH 63.
- Identity = validated SteamID64 (17 digits) only in paths/locks/bans/reports/ops. Writes: `WE_LockedLoad`/`WE_LockedCommit`, `WE_WriteFileLocked`, `WE_AppendFileLocked`; RMW inside the lock; honor false. Reads never lock. Soft locks are 1s TTL, one process per `basewf`.
- `WE_Cmds_Dispatch` enforces `requiresOperator`. Register `WE_Cmds_Add(name, params, desc, requiresOperator, handler)`. No `we_feature_*` for users or operators. Custom GT keys `cust_*` (`WE_SanitizeKey`); named KV `WE_KvFileGet/Set` with `[A-Za-z0-9_-]` stems.
- Cvars: paste `configs/warfork-extended.cfg.example` into `server.cfg` (never auto-write).
- Python and Go: Docker only (`make test` / `make prod` / `make go`). Host: make, zip, docker. `make test` must stay green; no engine mock. `VERSION` → release workflow. `idea/` not shipped.
